(House at once undertook the task of assisting members of the Exchange) Tj T*
(in closing up these contracts and used its clerical force for that) Tj T*
(purpose, thus involving much careful and detailed work. They held) Tj T*
(daily continuous meetings, giving their personal attention in) Tj T*
(assisting members, and using a care that involved both tact and) Tj T*
(arduous labor. Through their efforts such extraordinary progress was) Tj T*
(made, in this complex and difficult task, that by September 22nd) Tj T*
(announcement was made that the delivery of all Clearing House balances) Tj T*
(had been completed with the exception of those of the few firms whose) Tj T*
(affairs were in the hands of receivers. These were settled shortly) Tj T*
(afterwards and at the same time the great volume of Ex-Clearing House) Tj T*
(contracts were also completely fulfilled.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
