(way in which he undertook the task proposed to him soon convinced the) Tj T*
(Committee that they had not erred in resorting to him. He set about) Tj T*
(organizing a Committee at once and on September 24th he appeared) Tj T*
(before the Committee of Five accompanied by Messrs. A. C. Gwynne, F.) Tj T*
(H. Hatch, A. H. Lockett, and E. K. McCormick. These gentlemen) Tj T*
(announced that they were willing to act, with Mr. Smithers as their) Tj T*
(Chairman, and a plan for the control of the market in unlisted stocks) Tj T*
(was agreed upon.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In order to clothe this Committee \(which included two Stock Exchange) Tj T*
(members, two representatives of prominent outside dealers, and the) Tj T*
(President of the Curb Association\) with authority, the Committee of) Tj T*
(Five directed members of the Exchange to submit proposed dealings in) Tj T*
