(success be publicly attributed to them. An edifying confidence was) Tj T*
(thus shown in what were usually the most visionary of these schemes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(       *       *       *       *       *) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Space does not permit the presentation of all these multitudinous) Tj T*
(suggestions, but as a matter of information we shall quote extracts) Tj T*
(from some of them. In point of time, the first communication to the) Tj T*
(Committee on this subject came on August 4th when a prominent banker) Tj T*
(appeared in person, and gave vent to the following oracular utterance:) Tj T*
("When the Exchange reopens it should not do business from ten till) Tj T*
(three, but should open from ten o'clock to one. All transactions) Tj T*
(should be for cash, and must be delivered and paid for the same day,) Tj T*
(no contract to be allowed to stand over night." He also made the) Tj T*
(prediction, which was amply verified, that many weeks would elapse) Tj T*
(before the Exchange could be reopened at all. Some little time elapsed) Tj T*
(before anything further was presented on the subject, but by the end) Tj T*
(of August the flood of plans began and went on increasing until the) Tj T*
(Exchange resumed business.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(On August 31st a communication was received from a well known) Tj T*
("Statistical Organization" for "Merchants, Bankers and Investors") Tj T*
(which said, in part: "In behalf of my clients, who are exceedingly) Tj T*
(interested in making it possible for the Stock Exchanges to open) Tj T*
(safely, I am getting the opinion of important bodies relative to the) Tj T*
(proposed legislation suggested on the enclosed slip, or any other) Tj T*
(which you think would serve the purpose." On the enclosed slip was the) Tj T*
(following proposed legislation "to enable the Stock Exchanges to) Tj T*
(open.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "Be it enacted: That until the President considers European) Tj T*
(     conditions fairly normal it shall be a misdemeanor in this) Tj T*
(     country to buy, sell, transfer, give, or accept as collateral,) Tj T*
