() Tj T*
(Thus on Saturday, November 28th, the doors of the Stock Exchange were) Tj T*
(once more thrown open and a restricted market in listed bonds was) Tj T*
(established on the floor under the watchful eye of the Committee of) Tj T*
(Three. There was some hesitancy at first as to whether these bond) Tj T*
(transactions should be quoted on the ticker in the accustomed way, but) Tj T*
(before the day of opening came it was decided to report them as usual.) Tj T*
(By requiring that all trades should be for "cash" or "regular way") Tj T*
(and, in a subsequent ruling, by instructing all purchasers of bonds to) Tj T*
(report to the Committee when such bonds were not delivered by 2.15) Tj T*
(P.M. on the day following the purchase, it was hoped to impede any) Tj T*
(sudden or violent liquidation of foreign securities.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(       *       *       *       *       *) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The restoration of the bond market to the floor was a complete) Tj T*
(success, and at about the same time a general revival of public) Tj T*
(confidence showed itself in a rise in prices first in the street) Tj T*
(market and then in the Stock Exchange Clearing House itself.) Tj T*
(Encouraged by these symptoms the Committee of Five at once formulated) Tj T*
(a plan for carrying the reopening a step farther. A list of stocks) Tj T*
(which were not international in character was made out and submitted) Tj T*
(to the Bank Clearing House Committee, and with their concurrence it) Tj T*
(was decided to place these upon the floor of the Exchange to be traded) Tj T*
(in at or above certain prescribed minimum prices.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(At a meeting of the Governing Committee on December 7th the following) Tj T*
(resolution was adopted: "That the Committee of Five is hereby) Tj T*
(empowered to permit dealings on the floor of the Exchange in such) Tj T*
(stocks as it may designate under restrictions prescribed by it. That) Tj T*
(the Committee of Five is hereby authorized to enforce stock loan) Tj T*
(contracts whenever in its judgment it may deem best so to do, and that) Tj T*
(the resolution of July 31st, 1914, be modified in this respect.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A list of minimum prices was fixed upon that averaged some two or) Tj T*
(three points below the closing prices of July 31st, and on December) Tj T*
(11th the Committee issued a ruling prescribing the conditions for the) Tj T*
(partial resumption of stock dealings on the Exchange. We here present) Tj T*
(it in full:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "The Special Committee of Five rules that Rule 13 be rescinded,) Tj T*
(     in so far as it applies to stocks admitted to dealings in the) Tj T*
(     Exchange from time to time by the Committee of Five, said) Tj T*
(     rescission to take effect at the close of business on Friday,) Tj T*
(     December 11, 1914.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "Beginning on Saturday, December 12, 1914, dealings in certain) Tj T*
(     specified stocks listed on the Exchange will be permitted on the) Tj T*
(     floor of the Exchange between the hours of ten and three o'clock) Tj T*
(     each day except Saturday, when dealings shall cease at twelve) Tj T*
(     o'clock noon.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
