(     "Dealings in such stocks as shall be specified by, and be under) Tj T*
(     the supervision and regulation of the Committee, shall be for) Tj T*
(     'cash' or 'regular way' _only_ and not below the minimum prices) Tj T*
(     authorized by the Committee from time to time. Transactions at) Tj T*
(     prices below those allowed by the Committee, or in evasion of its) Tj T*
(     rules are prohibited.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "A list of stocks to be admitted to dealings on the Exchange) Tj T*
(     accompanies these rulings. Minimum prices on same will be) Tj T*
(     announced on December 11, 1914.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "All stocks quoted on July 30th at or below 15 per cent., or $15) Tj T*
(     per share, may be dealt in without restriction as to price, but) Tj T*
(     are included in the list for your guidance, and will be marked) Tj T*
(     'Free' in the price column.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "All stocks admitted to dealings as above, which were being) Tj T*
(     cleared through the Stock Exchange Clearing House at the close of) Tj T*
(     business on July 30, 1914, will be similarly cleared from the) Tj T*
(     opening of business on the 12th day of December, 1914.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "All stocks admitted to dealings, which were being dealt in) Tj T*
(     'Ex-Clearing House' at the close of business on July 30, 1914,) Tj T*
(     will be similarly dealt in from the opening of business on the) Tj T*
(     12th day of December, 1914.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "Stocks admitted to dealings on the Exchange will cease to be) Tj T*
(     dealt in through the Stock Exchange Committee on Clearing House.) Tj T*
(     Stocks not so admitted will continue to be dealt in through the) Tj T*
(     Committee on Clearing House until further notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "All rules of the Exchange governing delivery and default on) Tj T*
(     contracts covered by these rules shall be in force on and after) Tj T*
(     the 12th day of December, 1914, but the closing of contracts) Tj T*
(     'Under the Rule' shall be subject to the foregoing provisions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     STOCKS LOANED) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "The Loan Market for stocks will reopen at ten o'clock, A.M. on) Tj T*
(     the 12th day of December, 1914, for such stocks _only_ as are) Tj T*
(     admitted to dealings on the Exchange, from and after which date) Tj T*
(     all rules of the Exchange governing the borrowing and loaning of) Tj T*
(     such stocks shall be in force, but the closing of contracts) Tj T*
(     'Under the Rule' shall be subject to the foregoing provisions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "The above rule shall apply to stocks borrowed and loaned prior) Tj T*
(     to and since July 30, 1914.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     "Borrowed and loaned stocks will be cleared as before July 30th) Tj T*
(     last, but only in cases where such stocks are admitted to) Tj T*
(     dealings on the Exchange.) Tj T*
