(market. While this possibility lasted the maintenance of minimum) Tj T*
(prices furnished an automatic check upon sudden panic which would) Tj T*
(avoid raising the question of a second closing of the Exchange. In) Tj T*
(order to regulate these minimum prices and so change them from time to) Tj T*
(time as to keep in accord with normal supply and demand, it was) Tj T*
(necessary to appoint a Committee, and the original Five were continued) Tj T*
(in office with this sole regulative power. As bonds were similarly) Tj T*
(restricted, the Committee of Three also lingered on the scene for the) Tj T*
(same purpose. The two Committees performed this unusual function up to) Tj T*
(the first of April, 1915, when the very marked improvement in) Tj T*
(conditions led to the abandonment of this last vestige of artificial) Tj T*
(restraint.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is instructive, as showing the workings of some minds, that) Tj T*
(although the Committee of Five, in its capacity of regulator of) Tj T*
(minimum prices, issued a public statement that they were under no) Tj T*
(circumstances going to valorize or sustain prices but merely expected) Tj T*
(to maintain a safeguard against some unforeseen shock to confidence,) Tj T*
(many people wrote them urgent letters asking that in certain) Tj T*
(properties a minimum should be maintained which would render selling) Tj T*
(impossible. It was quite futile to try to disabuse some of these) Tj T*
(correspondents of the idea that no decline should be allowed in) Tj T*
(properties that they were interested in.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(       *       *       *       *       *) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(To one who meditates upon the singular experience which was thus) Tj T*
(abruptly brought to a close, there are a few features of it which) Tj T*
(stand out as meriting the especial attention of all members of the) Tj T*
(Stock Exchange. First of all it was most impressively shown what) Tj T*
(apparently hopeless tasks can be accomplished by loyal coöperation. If) Tj T*
(at any time up to July, 1914, any Wall Street man had asserted that) Tj T*
(the stock market could be kept closed continually for four and) Tj T*
(one-half months he would have been laughed to scorn, and yet this) Tj T*
(supposed impossibility was performed by the joint and determined) Tj T*
(action of the financial community. On the other hand, and as a) Tj T*
(counterpart to this valuable experience, it must never be lost sight) Tj T*
(of that the extraordinary war measures of 1914 may be a danger to the) Tj T*
(future if they are misinterpreted. There is a possibility \(even a) Tj T*
(probability\) that when ordinary crises arise in times to come, people) Tj T*
(who find themselves financially embarrassed will bring enormous) Tj T*
(pressure upon the authorities of the Exchange to renew the drastic) Tj T*
(expedients of the famous thirty-first of July. It is to be sincerely) Tj T*
(hoped that there will always be firmness enough in the Governing) Tj T*
(Committee to resist this pressure. The great world war coming, as it) Tj T*
(did, without warning was a rare and epoch-making event that warranted) Tj T*
(unheard of action and to indulge in such action for any lesser cause) Tj T*
(would be utterly disastrous.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Committee of Five seems to have been brought into existence under) Tj T*
(a lucky star. That five men called together so suddenly in such an) Tj T*
(emergency should have worked with absolute harmony for so long a time) Tj T*
ET
