(is quite remarkable. Their unanimity was never troubled but once. On) Tj T*
(one of the first few days of their career a rather positive and) Tj T*
(aggressive member, arguing with a colleague, said "you must remember) Tj T*
(that you are only one of this Committee." The Committeeman thus) Tj T*
(addressed responded with calm determination "and you must not forget) Tj T*
(that you are not the other four." This encounter excited much) Tj T*
(amusement among the remaining members and was the one and only) Tj T*
(occasion where anything resembling a serious difference appeared.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In addition to being blessed with harmony they were very fortunate in) Tj T*
(having passed rulings for so long a time without giving forth anything) Tj T*
(that had to be recalled. In view of the complexity of the conditions,) Tj T*
(fortune must have aided in this as well as judgment. They were, of) Tj T*
(course, treated to much wisdom \(after the event\) by their critics.) Tj T*
(They were told that they might have opened the Exchange sooner after) Tj T*
(the actual opening had proved a success, and they were informed in) Tj T*
(the editorial columns of a prominent journal that their fear of) Tj T*
(foreign liquidation had been an "obsession" which lacked) Tj T*
(justification. These critics never were heard from while the event was) Tj T*
(in doubt, and consequently the Committee did not profit much by their) Tj T*
(learned sayings.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It can be stated with confidence that the intelligent resourcefulness) Tj T*
(of the Stock Exchange, in conjunction with the splendid public) Tj T*
(spirited work of the New York banks and the press, warded off a) Tj T*
(calamity the possible magnitude of which it would be difficult to) Tj T*
(measure. The success of this undertaking should be a source of pride) Tj T*
(and emulation to those future generations of brokers who will have to) Tj T*
(solve the problems of the great financial market when in the words of) Tj T*
(Tyndall, "you and I, like streaks of morning cloud, shall have melted) Tj T*
(into the infinite azure of the past.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(THE END) Tj T*
